The final system should allow the application developer to write:

```php
$currentStore = app(CurrentStore::class);

if ($currentStore->hasFeature('inventory')) {
    // Inventory functionality
}
```

without knowing whether Inventory was obtained from:

```text
Growth plan
        OR
Growth trial
        OR
Admin grant
```

The system should also support future sources such as:

```text
Promotion
Coupon
Referral
Enterprise agreement
Manual support override
```

without requiring a redesign of the feature-checking API.

